  applicationbusinesstaxonomyvoc:marketing-communications skos:definition "All forms of communication used to promote a company’s brand, products, or services, including advertising, public relations, content marketing and social media marketing."@en .
  
  applicationbusinesstaxonomyvoc:brand skos:definition "A name, term, design, symbol, or other feature that identifies a company’s goods or services and distinguishes them from competitors."@en .
  
  applicationbusinesstaxonomyvoc:brand-awareness skos:definition "The extent to which consumers are familiar with a brand and its products or services."@en .
  
