  applicationbusinesstaxonomyvoc:price-market-research skos:definition "Analyzing competitor pricing, understanding customer willingness to pay and identifying pricing trends."@en .
  
  applicationbusinesstaxonomyvoc:price-perception skos:definition "How customers perceive the value of a product or service in relation to its price."@en .
  
  applicationbusinesstaxonomyvoc:pricing-strategy skos:definition "This includes concepts like cost-plus pricing, value-based pricing, competitive pricing, premium pricing, penetration pricing and dynamic pricing."@en .
  
  applicationbusinesstaxonomyvoc:pricing-tactics skos:definition "Techniques like discounts, promotions, bundling and psychological pricing."@en .
  
