  technicalservicesvoc:resource-protection skos:definition "The process of protecting resources, such as data and systems, from unauthorized access."@en .
  
  technicalservicesvoc:temporal-constraint-timer skos:definition "A restriction placed on one or more temporal data items, which represent time points or time periods"@en .
  
  technicalservicesvoc:token-assignment skos:definition "The process of managing and assigning tokens, which are used to authenticate users and authorize access to resources."@en .
  
  technicalservicesvoc:token-management skos:definition "The process of managing and assigning tokens, which are used to authenticate users and authorize access to resources."@en .
  
  technicalservicesvoc:exposure-analysis skos:definition "The process of identifying and assessing security vulnerabilities."@en .
  
  technicalservicesvoc:predictive-analytics skos:definition "The use of statistical techniques to predict future events."@en .
  
  technicalservicesvoc:resolution-assessment skos:definition "The process of assessing the effectiveness of security controls."@en .
  
  technicalservicesvoc:investigation skos:definition "A detailed analysis of detected threats to understand their nature, origin, potential impact, and to develop an effective incident response plan, including identifying and containing the incident, mitigating damage, and recovering compromised systems."@en .
  
  technicalservicesvoc:mitigation skos:definition "The proactive strategies and actions taken to reduce or minimize the potential impact of threats and vulnerabilities. It involves identifying risks, implementing protective measures, and continuously monitoring for threats to prevent security breaches."@en .
  
  technicalservicesvoc:monitoring skos:definition "A proactive security measure that enables organizations to detect, identify, and respond to potential security incidents in an increasingly sophisticated and pervasive era."@en .
  
  technicalservicesvoc:prevention skos:definition "Proactive measures and strategies implemented to block or deter threats from reaching or damaging systems, networks, or data before they can cause harm."@en .
  
  technicalservicesvoc:training skos:definition "Equipping individuals with the knowledge, skills, and awareness necessary to identify, assess, and respond to potential threats, ultimately enhancing an organization's ability to mitigate risks."@en .
}

<https://www.insperity.com/vocabulary/core-time/> {
  timevoc:time skos:definition "The indefinite continued progress of existence and events in the past, present, and future regarded as a whole."@en .
  
  timevoc:absolute skos:definition "A specific point in time, measurable and independent of other events."@en .
  
  timevoc:episodic skos:definition "Occurring in episodes or distinct periods."@en .
  
  timevoc:day skos:definition "A unit of time equal to 24 hours."@en .
  
  timevoc:hour skos:definition "A unit of time equal to 60 minutes."@en .
  
  timevoc:minute skos:definition "A unit of time equal to 60 seconds."@en .
  
  timevoc:month skos:definition "A unit of time typically consisting of 28-31 days, representing approximately one cycle of the moon’s phases."@en .
  
  timevoc:quarter skos:definition "A unit of time equal to three months."@en .
  
  timevoc:second skos:definition "A unit of time, a fraction of a minute."@en .
  
  timevoc:week skos:definition "A unit of time equal to seven days."@en .
  
  timevoc:year skos:definition "A unit of time equal to 12 months or approximately 365 days, representing the time it takes for the Earth to orbit the sun."@en .
  
  timevoc:full-period skos:definition "The complete duration of a specific time frame."@en .
  
  timevoc:multiple-periods skos:definition "Spanning across more than one time period."@en .
  
  timevoc:partial-period skos:definition "A portion or subset of a complete time period."@en .
  
  timevoc:daily skos:definition "Occurring every day."@en .
  
  timevoc:weekly skos:definition "Occurring every week."@en .
  
  timevoc:yearly skos:definition "Occurring every year."@en .
  
  timevoc:bi-weekly skos:definition "Occurring every two weeks."@en .
  
  timevoc:mid-year skos:definition "The middle point of a year."@en .
  
  timevoc:twice-per-week skos:definition "Occurring two times each week."@en .
  
  timevoc:current skos:definition "The present moment in time."@en .
  
  timevoc:future skos:definition "The complete duration of a specific time frame."@en .
  
  timevoc:past skos:definition "A point in time before the present."@en .
}

<https://www.insperity.com/vocabulary/core-valuestream/> {
  valuestreamvoc:value-stream skos:definition "A series of steps an organization undertakes to deliver a product or service to a customer, from initial concept to final delivery and beyond."@en .
  
  valuestreamvoc:customer-acquisition-and-onboarding skos:definition "Activities involved in attracting and acquiring new customers, and integrating them into the company’s products or services."@en .
  
  valuestreamvoc:customer-support-and-service-assurance skos:definition "Providing assistance and support to customers throughout their engagement, ensuring satisfaction and service quality."@en .
  
  valuestreamvoc:data-analytics-and-insights skos:definition "Collecting, processing, and analyzing data to gain insights, improve decision-making, and optimize processes within the value stream."@en .
  
  valuestreamvoc:infrastructure-and-facility-management skos:definition "Managing and maintaining the physical and technological infrastructure required to support the value stream activities."@en .
  
  valuestreamvoc:marketing-and-brand-management skos:definition "Creating and promoting the company’s brand and offerings to attract and retain customers."@en .
  
  valuestreamvoc:network-provisioning-and-maintenance skos:definition "Designing, deploying, and maintaining the network infrastructure necessary for service delivery."@en .
  
  valuestreamvoc:order-to-cash skos:definition "The end-to-end process of receiving and fulfilling customer orders, including payment processing and revenue recognition."@en .
  
  valuestreamvoc:product-development-and-innovation skos:definition "Designing, developing, and launching new products or services that meet customer needs and market demands."@en .
  
  valuestreamvoc:regulatory-compliance-and-governance skos:definition "Ensuring adherence to relevant laws, regulations, and industry standards across all value stream activities."@en .
  
  valuestreamvoc:revenue-management-and-billing skos:definition "Optimizing pricing strategies, managing billing cycles, and maximizing revenue generation."@en .
  
  valuestreamvoc:supply-chain-management skos:definition "Managing the flow of goods, services, and information from raw materials to final customer delivery."@en .
  
  valuestreamvoc:order-to-cash-customer-service-and-support skos:definition "Assisting customers throughout the order to cash cycle, addressing inquiries and resolving issues."@en .
  
  valuestreamvoc:order-to-cash-inventory-management skos:definition "Managing and tracking inventory levels to ensure timely order fulfillment and minimize stockouts."@en .
  
  valuestreamvoc:order-to-cash-invoicing skos:definition "Generating and issuing invoices to customers for goods or services provided."@en .
  
  valuestreamvoc:order-to-cash-order-fulfillment skos:definition "Picking, packing, and shipping customer orders accurately and efficiently."@en .
  
  valuestreamvoc:order-to-cash-order-management skos:definition "Receiving, processing, and tracking customer orders throughout the fulfillment process."@en .
  
  valuestreamvoc:order-to-cash-payment-processing skos:definition "Receiving and processing customer payments through various methods."@en .
  
  valuestreamvoc:order-to-cash-revenue-recognition skos:definition "Recognizing revenue generated from customer orders according to accounting standards."@en .
}

