  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:supplier-management-scheduling skos:definition "The process of scheduling deliveries and services from suppliers."@en .
  
  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:access-management skos:definition "The process of controlling who has access to IT systems and data."@en .
  
  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:customer-relationship-management skos:definition "The process of managing an organization’s interactions with its customers."@en .
  
  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:event-management skos:definition "The process of managing events that could impact IT services, including identifying, analyzing, and responding to events."@en .
  
  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:facilities-management skos:definition "The management of an organization’s physical infrastructure, such as buildings, equipment, and furniture."@en .
  
  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:help-desk-management skos:definition "The management of an organization’s help desk, which provides technical support to users."@en .
  
  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:human-resources-management skos:definition "The process of managing an organization’s workforce."@en .
  
  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:incident-management skos:definition "The process of managing and resolving IT incidents, which are events that disrupt or could disrupt IT services."@en .
  
  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:information-technology-operations skos:definition "The day-to-day operation of IT systems and infrastructure."@en .
  
  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:problem-management skos:definition "The process of managing and resolving the root causes of incidents."@en .
  
  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:request-fulfillment skos:definition "The process of fulfilling service requests from users."@en .
  
  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:customer-relationship-management-surveys-and-assessment
    skos:definition "The use of surveys and assessments to gather feedback from customers about their experiences with an organization."@en .
  
  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:customer-relationship-management-virtual-assistance
    skos:definition "The use of virtual assistants, such as chatbots, to provide customer support."@en .
  
  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:help-desk-management-escalation skos:definition "The process of escalating unresolved help desk tickets to higher levels of support."@en .
  
  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:human-resources-management-orchestration skos:definition
