  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:customer-impact skos:definition "The impact that an incident has on customers."@en .
  
  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:escalation skos:definition "The process of escalating an incident to a higher level of support."@en .
  
  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:operations-impact skos:definition "The impact that an incident has on IT operations."@en .
  
  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:prevention skos:definition "The process of taking steps to prevent incidents from occurring."@en .
  
  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:license-management skos:definition "The process of managing software licenses to ensure compliance with licensing agreements."@en .
  
  domaininformationtechnologyvoc:problem-capture-and-rationalization skos:definition
