  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/TransactionalJourneyDesign>
    skos:definition "The process of designing user experiences for completing specific tasks or transactions."@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/TranslationServices>
    skos:definition "Services that provide translation of text and other content into different languages."@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/ProcessManagement>
