  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/QualityEngineering>
    skos:definition "The process of ensuring that software products and services meet quality standards."@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/ChangeManagement>
