  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/CertificationManagement>
    skos:definition "The process of managing certifications for systems, applications, and individuals."@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/SecurityManagement>
    skos:definition "The process of managing security risks to systems and data."@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/ArchitectureAlignment>
    skos:definition "Ensuring that systems and applications are aligned with the overall enterprise architecture."@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/EntityLifecyclePattern>
    skos:definition "A pattern that describes the lifecycle of an entity in a system."@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/IdentityLifecyclePattern>
