  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/CreateReadUpdateDeleteProvisioning>
    skos:definition "The process of provisioning access to create, read, update, and delete data."@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/ServicesProvisioning>
