  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/DataManagement>
    skos:definition "Encompasses the practices of collecting, organizing, protecting, and storing an organization's data to enable analysis and informed business decisions."@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/DataMapping> skos:definition
      "The process of mapping data between different systems or applications."@en .
  
