  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/ContentAccess>
    skos:definition "Access to content, such as documents, images, and videos."@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/DataAccess> skos:definition
      "The ability to retrieve, modify, copy, or move data from IT systems on demand, ensuring users can access the necessary information while maintaining security and adhering to organizational policies."@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/DirectoryMaintenance>
