<https://www.insperity.com/vocabulary/application-data-domain/> {
  applicationdatadomainvoc:customer-experience-performance skos:example """
• Average response time to customer complaints 
• Net Promoter Score (NPS) by product type 
• Volume of service issues reported per month 
• SLA breach rate by service or region 
• CSAT scores after support interactions"""@en;
    skos:related applicationdatadomainvoc:performance .
  
  applicationdatadomainvoc:service-catalog skos:example """Examples of Entries in the Network Service Catalogue:
        •        LTE Access Service
        •        DWDM Transport Service
        •        Virtual Firewall Service
        •        5G Low-Latency Network Slice Service"""@en;
    skos:scopeNote """        •        Includes only network services (access, transport, core, virtualized, etc.)
        •        Organizes specifications by service type, technology domain, or use case
        •        Serves orchestration and fulfillment systems for service instantiation
        •        Excludes commercial product configurations and customer-facing bundles
"""@en;
    skos:related applicationdatadomainvoc:catalog .
  
  applicationdatadomainvoc:resource-facing-service-specification skos:example """  •        VNF-Based Firewall Service Specification
        •        Fiber Port Access Service Specification
        •        5G gNodeB Access Service Specification
        •        SD-WAN Overlay Resource Service Specification"""@en;
    skos:scopeNote """
        •        Models services tightly coupled with infrastructure elements (e.g., ports, links, VNFs, slices)
