  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-decision/> prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core/DecisionTaxonomy> .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-event/> prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core/EventTaxonomy> .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-governance/> prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core/GovernanceTaxonomy> .
  
